  "staleSwitchBatch": {
    "_comment": "The same-run rule on the row keys (review round of #1947): Camera Switch ran with all four clips kept and saved its batch of four; the person has dropped clip 1 since, and only the render runs. The render iterates the switch's SAVED batch (rows 0-3, row 1 cut clip 1), so the review as it is now (three kept clips) cannot name its rows: no row is keyed, and the failed row 1 names no clip. Both engine tests read it; the editor test also checks no card but clip 1's reads Preview failed.",
    "name": "a Camera Switch batch saved under an older review, a render-only run",
    "dropped": [
      1
    ],
